              <td><a class="ref" data-ref="2 Timothy 3:15-17">2 Timothy 3:15–17</a>;
              <a class="ref" data-ref="1 Thessalonians 2:13">1 Thessalonians 2:13</a>;
              <a class="ref" data-ref="2 Peter 1:21">2 Peter 1:21</a>;
