              <td><a class="ref" data-ref="Romans 3:21-26">Romans 3:21–26</a>;
              <a class="ref" data-ref="Romans 5:1">Romans 5:1</a>;
              <a class="ref" data-ref="Galatians 2:16">Galatians 2:16</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Methodist / Wesleyan</strong></td>
              <td><cite>Articles of Religion</cite> IX reproduces Anglican XI on
              justification by faith. Wesley distinguished justification (what God does
