              <cite>A Plain Account of Christian Perfection</cite> (1777).</td>
              <td><a class="ref" data-ref="Romans 3:23-25">Romans 3:23–25</a>;
              <a class="ref" data-ref="Romans 5:1">Romans 5:1</a>;
              <a class="ref" data-ref="1 Thessalonians 5:23">1 Thessalonians 5:23</a>;
              <a class="ref" data-ref="Matthew 5:48">Matthew 5:48</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Pentecostal</strong></td>
              <td><cite>Statement of Fundamental Truths</cite> 5: salvation is received
