              sacrifice, re-presenting Calvary (Trent XXII).</td>
              <td><a class="ref" data-ref="Matthew 26:26-28">Matthew 26:26–28</a>;
              <a class="ref" data-ref="John 6:51-58">John 6:51–58</a>;
